Strategy 3: Clustered [Equation]Tree File Organization on TxnID (Index-Organized Table) 

Principle: A dynamic balanced search tree where internal nodes store routing keys and block pointers, and leaf nodes directly store the [Equation]TXN records linked via a doubly-linked list.  

Justification: Combines logarithmic equality look-up with sequential leaf-level traversal for range scans, while natively handling out-of-order insertions or deletions via balanced node splits and merges without file reorganization.  

